00:01:15.150 --> 00:01:22.700
Okay, let's get the elephant out of the room,
as in let's talk about the elephant. Remember

00:01:22.700 --> 00:01:27.641
how these guys are all supposed to be high
schoolers? Well, Todo looks like a 28 year

00:01:27.641 --> 00:01:32.409
old philosophy student f***d a truck-load
