00:06:27.629 --> 00:06:32.210
Out of all the things to love about Todo,
my favorite thing is probably the way he gets

00:06:32.210 --> 00:06:37.790
introduced into the story. Basically Akutami
hits us with the worst part of his personality

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:42.900
to paint this picture of a blood-hungry idiot,
who judges people based on their taste of

00:06:42.900 --> 00:06:48.830
women...which he does, but as you will see,
surprisingly there is lot more behind this.

00:06:48.830 --> 00:06:58.330
Anyways, so after basically beating Megumi
into a pulp for having a decent view of women,

00:06:58.330 --> 00:07:03.099
- We get a pretty rapid turnaround for his
character. First we see him going against

00:07:03.099 --> 00:07:08.409
the plan to assassinate Yuji, basically having
as little respect for his classmates and teachers

00:07:08.409 --> 00:07:15.360
as for Megumi. Still no reason to like him,
but at least we get, that this man acts on

00:07:15.360 --> 00:07:20.419
his own principals and isn't just a dick for
the sake of it. And the we of course get his

00:07:20.419 --> 00:07:25.840
interaction with Itadori. And oh boy, is it
no surprise that these two click. - After

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:31.530
making up a fake flashback in his head, that
has more plot development than most regular

00:07:31.530 --> 00:07:39.930
anime do, Todo suddenly sees Itadori as his
best friend and from then on mentors Yuji

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:46.120
and brings him to a completely different level
in a number of minutes, suddenly turning him

00:07:46.120 --> 00:07:51.139
into an absolute fan favorite. Oh and can
we talk about the fact, that Todo got rejected

00:07:51.139 --> 00:07:58.289
in his own fantasy AND chose Itadori over
his love. What a true bro.

00:07:58.289 --> 00:08:05.689
Now we don't really know if theses fake memories
have something to do with Yui or wether they

00:08:05.689 --> 00:08:11.321
simply are part of quirky personality, as
I personally like to think. After all, in

00:08:11.321 --> 00:08:16.680
his fight with Hanami, Todo has an entire
imaginary tactical meeting with his favorite

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:32.590
pop idol in the blink of second. - So I think
that crafting a made up back story for one

00:08:32.590 --> 00:08:38.630
few people he can respect in the world, next
to anyone who is stronger than him, in other

00:08:38.630 --> 00:08:44.710
words special grades like Gojo, is very much
in character for Todo. And I think this proves

00:08:44.710 --> 00:08:50.290
how smart a cookie he actually is. After all
you will find it hard to describe this creative

00:08:50.290 --> 00:08:56.280
ability together with the ridiculously fast
analytical information processing as anything

00:08:56.280 --> 00:09:02.650
but intelligent. On top of all this Todo is
an extremely smart and dexterous fighter when

00:09:02.650 --> 00:09:10.220
he has to, unpacking his cursed technique
to its fullest against Hanami, an enemy he

00:09:10.220 --> 00:09:12.290
cannot beat with power alone.

00:09:12.290 --> 00:09:17.650
However, this sort of intelligence, while
without any doubt impressive, pales in comparison

00:09:17.650 --> 00:09:24.090
to the part of Todo's character that I find
truly impressive. His abs. I'm just kidding,

00:09:24.090 --> 00:09:29.340
the truly impressive part about Todo is his
philosophy and approach to the central moral

00:09:29.340 --> 00:09:42.590
question of the story, that make him one of
the most wise characters in the story. -

00:09:42.590 --> 00:09:49.090
Todo's answer to 'what makes a good life worth
living?' is basically existentialism. While

00:09:49.090 --> 00:09:54.270
jus like Nanami or Mahito, he understands
that life doesn't have meaning in itself and

00:09:54.270 --> 00:10:00.320
that very much in the Buddhist way of thinking,
everything is fleeting, Todo believes that

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:06.730
people are capable of making their own purpose
and find a reason to love and embrace life.

00:10:06.730 --> 00:10:11.780
His understanding of the natural world even
gives him a better understanding of cursed

00:10:11.780 --> 00:10:18.410
energy. And other than Mahito, who as I explained
in my last video, wants to fully embrace his

00:10:18.410 --> 00:10:24.150
nature, Todo gives Yuji agency, by telling
him to accept being part of nature, while

00:10:24.150 --> 00:10:35.000
still having his own will and swallowing his
anger. Todo is someone who fights against

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:39.840
the natural order of things, for the sake
of the love he feels for other people. He

00:10:39.840 --> 00:10:45.640
even literally fights Hanami, who is an embodiment
of nature. In fact, as ironic as it might

00:10:45.640 --> 00:10:51.441
seem, - believe me I know - love is actually
the big theme behind Todo's character. So

00:10:51.441 --> 00:10:57.770
much so, that Akutami even draws his cursed
energy as taking the form of little hearts.

00:10:57.770 --> 00:11:02.270
Love in general is a very prominent theme
in Jujutsu Kaisen, that often is contrasted

00:11:02.270 --> 00:11:12.190
with 
the curses. -Junpei-

00:11:12.190 --> 00:11:17.370
What appears as comical and over the top on
the outside, when Todo suddenly treats Yuji

00:11:17.370 --> 00:11:21.870
as if they had known each other since birth,
is actually Todo embracing his friendship

00:11:21.870 --> 00:11:27.360
and brotherly love for Yuji as one of the
driving factors in his life. Just as his love

00:11:27.360 --> 00:11:32.990
for Takada. Even though, they aren't even
real, to Todo they are and they give him meaning

00:11:32.990 --> 00:11:47.110
and happiness. Not by accident, but by choice.

00:11:47.110 --> 00:11:52.360
And even his seemingly macho-like habit of
judging people based on their type of partner,

00:11:52.360 --> 00:11:57.200
gets twisted on his head, when we learn that
he isn't just a superficial duche, but actually

00:11:57.200 --> 00:12:04.250
inherited this quirk as well as his philosophy
from the mysterious motorbike woman we meet.

00:12:04.250 --> 00:12:10.310
What Todo actually does by asking the question,
is figuring out whether or not people can

00:12:10.310 --> 00:12:23.480
state their true feeling and know what they
love. It's not that everyone needs to love

00:12:23.480 --> 00:12:30.020
Jennifer Lawrence, it's that Yuji has no issues
saying what he loves, while Megumi does. Though

00:12:30.020 --> 00:12:38.880
I think you agree, that that doesn't mean
you have to punch him into the ground. The

00:12:38.880 --> 00:12:44.320
fact that not everyone is able to state what
they love or even know what they love is something

00:12:44.320 --> 00:12:48.660
todo has to learn to understand. His basic
need as a character.

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:53.130
As a result Todo is written as a twist on
the unwind trope that strong guys are always

00:12:53.130 --> 00:12:58.790
stupid and for some reason weak, making him
one of the strongest and wisest characters

00:12:58.790 --> 00:13:13.620
in the story, while still being as bat shit
crazy as all of them really are. He is one

00:13:13.620 --> 00:13:18.690
of the central guides to Itadori's growth
and without any doubt part of the relationships

00:13:18.690 --> 00:13:23.700
that Yuji will someday have to discover as
his true source of meaning and happiness in

00:13:23.700 --> 00:13:28.790
life. In short, pretty much as most characters
in Jujutsu Kaisen, Aoi Todo might as well

00:13:28.790 --> 00:13:34.410
be the main character. Like Maki or Fushiguro,
he's pretty much peak Shounen protagonist

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:49.990
material. And that's what makes him such a
lovable character.

